    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Saga of the Great Wolf",
    "summary": "As [your Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, you can pick a Hunting Pack from the list below. It stays active for all your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES** units until [your next Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase). No Hunting Pack can be picked more than once in the battle.\n\n- **Encircling Jaws**: the unit can re-roll its [Advance rolls](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) and [Charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step).\n- **Hunter’s Eye**: ranged attacks by the unit's models get +1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).\n- **Ferocious Strike**: whenever the unit gets **selected to fight**, pick **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)** or **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**. Weapons of its models get that ability for the rest of the phase.",
